  "question": "Where can I find a university inside a 120 kilometers radius toward the east of Maryvale Baseball Park, Phoenix, AZ?",
  "sql": "\nWITH origin AS  (SELECT ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-112.173653 33.489497)',4326)::geography AS geometry)\nSELECT * FROM pois, origin\nWHERE ST_DWithin(pois.geometry, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-112.173653 33.489497)',4326)::geography, 120000)\nAND amenity = 'university'\nAND degrees(ST_Azimuth(origin.geometry, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN 67.5 AND 112.5;\n",
